WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:09.944
All five subjects have marks. Now Mrs. Sunita Sharma turns them into results, checks them, approves them, and publishes them to students.

00:00:11.286 --> 00:00:20.882
First, on the exam's Setup page, close marks entry. Teachers can no longer change marks; it can be reopened, with a reason, if needed.

00:00:22.523 --> 00:00:31.638
Open the Results tab. Only Mathematics was submitted by its teacher; the others were entered by the office, so ScoreCode asks for a reason.

00:00:32.543 --> 00:00:39.842
Choose Process results, write the reason, and confirm. Every result is computed with the Class 10 grading scheme.

00:00:42.297 --> 00:00:49.257
Here is the summary: how many students passed, and how many did not. Nothing is visible to students yet.

00:00:49.963 --> 00:00:58.682
Worth a look lists things to check before approving, such as missing marks. Here it notes that some papers were processed before they were submitted.

00:01:02.276 --> 00:01:07.594
Open any student to see their result exactly as they will see it. This is Aarav's.

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:17.118
Everything looks right, so approve the results. Approving locks every mark and records this exact set of results.

00:01:19.176 --> 00:01:27.048
On Growth and Pro you can schedule results to go live at a set time. Sunrise is on the Free plan, so we publish now.

00:01:29.972 --> 00:01:34.959
Publish now, and confirm. Each student sees their own result straight away.

00:01:36.748 --> 00:01:43.686
ScoreCode now prepares a PDF marksheet for every student. Here it shows them being prepared, and then ready.

00:01:46.663 --> 00:01:55.565
If a mistake is found later, results can be withdrawn with a reason, or corrected and published again. Next, what a student sees.
